Description: Single-process TeslaMate (Rust + SQLite)
 teslamate-rs is a RAM-saving TeslaMate rewrite: Rust binary, SQLite,
 and a built-in Grafana-parity dashboard UI in one process.
 .
 The daemon listens on 127.0.0.1:4010 by default. Service data (SQLite
 database and WAL files) lives in /srv/teslamate-rs. Override bind, port,
 and database path via /etc/default/teslamate-rs.
 .
 This package does not replace a live Docker TeslaMate install; it binds
 a different port (4010 vs 4000).
